  "id": "risk-aversion",
  "term": "risk aversion",
  "definition": "Risk aversion is a tendency to view risk negatively and to be less willing to choose risky options, reflecting greater sensitivity to risk. In this context, higher risk aversion is described as a possible protective factor against gambling disorder.",
