      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not provide a definition for “risk aversion” as “a tendency to view risk negatively” or as “greater sensitivity to risk”; it only describes that risk aversion is investigated in relation to gambling disorder and contrasts it with risk sensitivity/preferred risky choices.",
        "The claim that higher risk aversion is “a possible protective factor against gambling disorder” is broadly consistent with the packet (“potential protective factor”), but the rest of the definition’s core description (negative viewing of risk, reduced willingness to choose risky options, and sensitivity framing) is not supported by the packet’s text.",
        "The packet does not state the exact wording about “less willing to choose risky options” or “reflecting greater sensitivity to risk,” so the definitional components are unsupported."
